# ESC # 8 (DECALN) fills the whole screen with 'E' and homes the cursor.
# This is a two-byte escape with an intermediate; parsers that only consume the
# intermediate print a stray '8' instead.
size: 6x3
description: DECALN fills the screen and homes the cursor

--- input
\e#8

--- expect-grid
|EEEEEE|
|EEEEEE|
|EEEEEE|

--- expect-cursor
row=0 col=0
